2026-07-27T08:55:00.1300740Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:55:00.1368594Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:55:00.1369754Z i /tmp/RtmpFBNIoJ/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:55:00.1370208Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:55:00.1370684Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:55:00.1371507Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:55:00.1372135Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:55:00.1373026Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:55:00.1373683Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:55:00.1642127Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:55:00.1758382Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:55:00.2234259Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:55:00.2409846Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
